<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Sister Pin Guide</title>
<meta name="description" content="Tournament strategy, PinTips and venue notes for every pinball machine at Sister in Albuquerque.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: dark "arcade terminal" — a DMD dot-matrix hero, then a crosshair-ticked grid of machine cards; each card opens a hash-routed detail page that leads with the tournament plan. */
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #08090c;
  --bg-2: #0c0e13;
  --panel: #101218;
  --line: #242833;
  --line-2: #363b49;
  --fg: #c6cad8;
  --fg-hi: #eceef5;
  --fg-dim: #7d8296;
  --dmd: #ff6b1f;
  --dmd-soft: rgba(255, 107, 31, 0.14);
  --dmd-off: #24150e;
  --warn: #f2b13d;
  --warn-soft: rgba(242, 177, 61, 0.10);
  --cat-multiball: #6fd3c4;
  --cat-skillshot: #e9cf6a;
  --cat-secret: #e57fb0;
  --cat-general: #9aa3bf;
  --cat-wizard: #a993f0;
  --f-display: "Instrument Serif", "Iowan Old Style", "Times New Roman", serif;
  --f-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, monospace;
  --f-body: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  --max: 1120px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { background: var(--bg); }
body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font-family: var(--f-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
body::before {
  content: ""; position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; height: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  z-index: 10; background: var(--bg);
}
a { color: inherit; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--dmd); outline-offset: 3px; }

.wrap {
  max-width: var(--max);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));
  padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
}
.mono { font-family: var(--f-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-size: 11.5px; }
.dim { color: var(--fg-dim); }

/* ---------- top bar ---------- */
.bar {
  position: sticky; top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 5;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.bar .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-block: 12px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg-hi); }
.brand-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--dmd); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--dmd); }
.bar-right { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero { padding-block: 44px 28px; }
.hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
.eyebrow { color: var(--dmd); }
h1 {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; color: var(--fg-hi);
  font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 80px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 14px 0 16px; text-wrap: balance;
}
h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--fg); }
.lede { max-width: 52ch; color: var(--fg); margin: 0 0 20px; }
.tally { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; }
.tally span b { color: var(--fg-hi); font-weight: 500; }

.dmd-frame { border: 1px solid var(--line-2); background: #050506; }
.dmd-title { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); color: var(--fg-dim); }
.dmd-screen { padding: 12px; }
#dmd { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 1; max-width: 100%; }

/* ---------- venue strip ---------- */
.venue { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-block: 8px 18px; }
.venue > div { padding: 14px 16px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; }
.venue > div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.venue .k { color: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.venue p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; }

details.basics { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-2); margin-bottom: 26px; }
details.basics summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 12px 16px; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; color: var(--fg-hi); }
details.basics summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
details.basics summary .tog::before { content: "[+]"; color: var(--dmd); }
details.basics[open] summary .tog::before { content: "[–]"; }
details.basics ul { margin: 0; padding: 0 16px 16px 34px; display: grid; gap: 8px; max-width: 80ch; }

/* ---------- controls ---------- */
.controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 14px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.search { position: relative; flex: 1 1 240px; max-width: 360px; }
.search input {
  width: 100%; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line-2); color: var(--fg-hi);
  font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 12px 10px 34px; border-radius: 0;
}
.search input::placeholder { color: var(--fg-dim); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-size: 11.5px; }
.search::before { content: ">"; position: absolute; left: 13px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-52%); color: var(--dmd); font-family: var(--f-mono); }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.chip {
  font-family: var(--f-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-size: 11px;
  background: transparent; color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 7px 10px; cursor: pointer;
  display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;
}
.chip:hover { border-color: var(--fg-dim); color: var(--fg-hi); }
.chip[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--dmd); border-color: var(--dmd); color: #140904; }
.chip .n { opacity: 0.7; }

/* ---------- grid ---------- */
.grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.card {
  position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  padding: 18px 18px 16px; text-decoration: none; min-width: 0;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  transition: background 0.15s ease;
}
.card::before, .card::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; width: 9px; height: 9px; pointer-events: none;
  border-color: var(--line-2); border-style: solid; border-width: 0;
}
.card::before { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-top-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; }
.card::after { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; }
.card:hover { background: var(--panel); }
.card:hover::before, .card:hover::after { border-color: var(--dmd); }
.card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; }
.code {
  font-family: var(--f-mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--dmd) 42%, transparent 48%) 0 0 / 3px 3px;
  -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(255, 107, 31, 0.35));
}
.card h3 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.02; color: var(--fg-hi); margin: 4px 0 0; text-wrap: balance; }
.card .meta { color: var(--fg-dim); }
.card .line { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg); }
.flags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; }
.flag { font-family: var(--f-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 10.5px; padding: 3px 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line-2); color: var(--fg-dim); display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; }
.flag.warn { color: var(--warn); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 45%, transparent); background: var(--warn-soft); }
.sq { width: 7px; height: 7px; display: inline-block; flex: none; background: currentColor; }
.empty { padding: 30px 18px; color: var(--fg-dim); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); grid-column: 1 / -1; }

footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 22px 40px; color: var(--fg-dim); font-size: 13px; }
footer p { margin: 0 0 8px; max-width: 90ch; }
footer a { color: var(--fg); }

/* ---------- detail ---------- */
.detail { padding-block: 22px 10px; }
.crumbs { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.crumbs a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg); }
.crumbs a:hover { color: var(--dmd); }
.d-head { border: 1px solid var(--line-2); background: var(--bg-2); margin-bottom: 22px; }
.d-title-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); color: var(--fg-dim); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.d-head-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 22px; padding: 22px 18px; align-items: center; }
.d-head .code { font-size: clamp(44px, 9vw, 72px); background-size: 4px 4px; }
.d-head h2 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; color: var(--fg-hi); font-size: clamp(36px, 5.6vw, 58px); line-height: 0.98; margin: 0 0 8px; text-wrap: balance; }
.thesis {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-style: italic; color: var(--fg-hi);
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 34ch; text-wrap: balance;
}
.thesis .tag { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--dmd); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.d-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 22px; align-items: start; }
.col { display: grid; gap: 22px; min-width: 0; }
.sec { border: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; }
.sec-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--fg-hi); }
.sec-h .dim { color: var(--fg-dim); }
.sec-b { padding: 14px 16px 16px; }
.sec.primary { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dmd) 55%, var(--line)); }
.sec.primary .sec-h { color: var(--dmd); border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dmd) 35%, var(--line)); }
ol.plan { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; counter-reset: p; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
ol.plan li { counter-increment: p; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
ol.plan li::before { content: counter(p, decimal-leading-zero); font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--dmd); padding-top: 3px; }
ul.plain { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
ul.plain li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
ul.plain li::before { content: "×"; font-family: var(--f-mono); color: var(--fg-dim); }
ul.copy li::before { content: "■"; font-size: 9px; padding-top: 5px; color: var(--fg-dim); }
.note { border-left: 2px solid var(--warn); background: var(--warn-soft); padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.note q { color: var(--fg-hi); quotes: "“" "”"; }
.note .by { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--fg-dim); }
.scores { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-top: 4px; }
.scores td { padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13.5px; }
.scores td:first-child { font-family: var(--f-mono); color: var(--fg-dim); width: 34px; }
.scores td.s { font-family: var(--f-mono); color: var(--fg-hi); }
.scores td.w { text-align: right; color: var(--fg-dim); font-size: 12.5px; }
.sub { margin: 14px 0 8px; color: var(--fg-dim); }
.sub:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.tips { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.tips li { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.tip-meta { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
.tip-meta .cat { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; }
.votes { color: var(--fg-dim); }
.rules { margin: 0; }
.srcs { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.srcs a { color: var(--fg); text-decoration-color: var(--line-2); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
.srcs a:hover { color: var(--dmd); }
.pager { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-block: 26px 30px; }
.pager a { padding: 14px 16px; text-decoration: none; display: grid; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
.pager a + a { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: right; }
.pager a:hover { background: var(--panel); }
.pager .nm { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 22px; color: var(--fg-hi); line-height: 1.1; }

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .hero-grid, .d-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .hero { padding-block: 28px 20px; }
  .venue { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .venue > div:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
  .venue > div:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
}
@media (max-width: 520px) {
  .venue { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .venue > div { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .venue > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .d-head-body { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
  .bar-right .hide-sm { display: none; }
  .pager { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .pager a + a { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { transition: none !important; }
}

/* Base reset for standalone hosting */
:root { padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px); }
body { margin: 0; }
img { max-width: 100%; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="bar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand mono" href="#"><span class="brand-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sister / Pin Guide</a>
    <div class="bar-right mono dim"><span class="hide-sm">407 Central Ave NW</span><span id="bar-count">16 machines</span></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="mono eyebrow">[ Tournament guide · Albuquerque, NM ]</div>
        <h1>Walk up to every game <em>with a plan.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tournament strategy for all 16 machines on the floor at Sister, with community tips from PinTips and notes on how each copy is playing right now.</p>
        <div class="tally mono dim" id="tally"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dmd-frame" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="dmd-title mono"><span>■ DMD 128×32</span><span>Sister · ABQ</span></div>
        <div class="dmd-screen"><canvas id="dmd" width="512" height="128"></canvas></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="venue" aria-label="Venue details">
      <div><div class="k mono">Hours</div><p>Tue–Thu 4pm–midnight<br>Fri–Sun 2pm–midnight<br>Closed Mondays</p></div>
      <div><div class="k mono">Paying</div><p>Quarters only. The bill changer takes $1, $5, $10 and $20.</p></div>
      <div><div class="k mono">Operator</div><p>Rotating lineup maintained by Geekon LLC.</p></div>
      <div><div class="k mono">Lineup checked</div><p>Nov 4, 2026 on Pinball Map. Games rotate, so confirm before an event.</p></div>
    </div>

    <details class="basics" id="basics">
      <summary class="mono"><span>Match play basics</span><span class="tog" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <ul>
        <li>You only need to beat the other players in your group on this game. On your last ball, know the number you need and take the lowest-risk route to it.</li>
        <li>Spend ball one learning the copy: flipper strength, outlane posts, which shots come back safely. Known issues for each machine are listed under <b>At Sister</b>.</li>
        <li>Call the tournament director for a stuck ball, a flipper that won’t hold, or a shot that doesn’t register. Rulings come before you play through it, not after.</li>
        <li>Bring quarters or small bills. The machines here are coin-op, and most events add a coin drop to the entry fee.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>

    <div class="controls">
      <label class="search" for="q"><span class="mono" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)">Search machines</span>
        <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search by name or code" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <div class="chips" id="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter machines"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
  </div>
</main>

<main id="detail" class="detail" hidden>
  <div class="wrap" id="detail-body"></div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>Lineup, machine comments and high scores come from <a href="https://pinballmap.com/map/?by_location_id=6422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pinball Map</a> (last updated Nov 4, 2026). Community tips are summarized from <a href="https://app.matchplay.events/opdb/entries/G4do5/pintips" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PinTips on Match Play</a>. Tournament strategy draws on Kineticist tutorials, The Pinball Primer, Pinball Rulesheets and the Tilt Forums archive; each machine page links its sources.</p>
    <p>Machine conditions change between visits. Comments are as posted by players and may already be fixed. Not affiliated with Sister or Geekon LLC.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
const PM = "https://pinballmap.com/map/?by_location_id=6422";
const PT = g => "https://app.matchplay.events/opdb/entries/" + g + "/pintips";

const MACHINES = [
{
  id: "attack-from-mars", code: "AFM", name: "Attack From Mars", sort: "Attack From Mars",
  mfr: "Chicago Gaming", year: 2017, variant: "Remake LE", group: "chicago", opdb: "G4do5",
  thesis: "Test the saucer on ball one. If it’s safe, play saucers. If it isn’t, play ramps and orbits for Total Annihilation.",
  plan: [
    "Find out early how safely the saucer and its forcefield shoot on this copy. When they’re safe, saucers are the main points source: the first is worth 200M and each one after adds another 200M.",
    "Use the super skill shot (hold the left flipper as you launch) to knock out the center bank, so you never have to shoot the forcefield.",
    "Start an Attack Wave before you start multiball. The extra balls can keep hitting the saucer while you collect jackpots.",
    "If the saucer looks dangerous, treat the four ramps and orbits as one set. Three of each starts Total Annihilation, the safer path, and a good run is worth around 2B.",
    "Martian Attack stacks with other multiballs. Save Martian Bombs for the last Martian, so the button starts a multiball when you need a save.",
    "The center ramp is the best single shot on the game: it lights locks and feeds the left flipper."
  ],
  avoid: [
    "Shooting the forcefield when the super skill shot or Stroke of Luck can open it for you.",
    "Spending Martian Bombs early, when each one only kills a single Martian.",
    "Completing in/outlanes when Stroke of Luck is already lit and extra balls are off."
  ],
  venue: {
    notes: [],
    copy: [
      "This is the Chicago Gaming remake. Competitive players often treat the remakes as playing differently from the originals even with the same rules, so take a feel for the flippers before committing to saucer shots.",
      "A ball wedged into the saucer is a known AFM quirk that many events leave in play. Ask the TD before you count on it."
    ],
    scores: [["5,132,247,930", "turndown4what", "Oct 17, 2026"]]
  },
  tips: [
    ["secret", 17, "In video mode, the launch button works once as a smart bomb that clears every saucer on screen."],
    ["general", 11, "Only take the super skill shot to knock out the center bank. If the bank is already down, take a regular skill shot."],
    ["skillshot", 10, "Hold the left flipper while launching, then make any shot within a few seconds to complete that lane or start a Saucer Attack Wave."],
    ["multiball", 9, "Three shots to each ramp and orbit starts Total Annihilation, a 4-ball multiball where every shot scores big."],
    ["multiball", 4, "Bring the visor down before you start multiball so the extra balls can finish off the saucer."],
    ["general", 4, "In Total Annihilation, the orbits and the cow/lobster ramps grow the jackpot; the lock ramp collects it."]
  ],
  rules: "Ramps and orbits build toward Total Annihilation. The center ramp lights locks for multiball. Drop the forcefield and hit the saucer to destroy it; Martians at the targets build Martian Attack. Conquering every nation leads to Rule the Universe.",
  sources: [
    ["Kineticist: Attack From Mars tutorial", "https://www.kineticist.com/post/attack-from-mars-pinball-tutorial"],
    ["Pinball Primer: Attack From Mars", "https://pinballprimer.github.io/afm_G4do5.html"],
    ["Tilt Forums: remakes vs. originals", "https://tiltforums.com/t/medieval-madness-williams-1997/444"]
  ]
},
{
  id: "back-to-the-future", code: "BTTF", name: "Back to the Future", sort: "Back to the Future",
  mfr: "Data East", year: 1990, variant: "", group: "classic", opdb: "GRpbW",
  thesis: "Left ramp, over and over. Switch to DMC multiball if the right flipper can’t make it.",
  plan: [
    "Early in the game, loop the left ramp. Ramp combos score rising values and eventually light an extra ball.",
    "Every ramp shot adds a DELOREAN letter. Spelling it opens a short window where the ramps score millions, so keep looping the left ramp through it.",
    "If the right flipper is too weak to make the left ramp, or DeLorean Millions has shrunk too far to matter, switch to multiball: complete the DMC drop targets to light locks at the upper-left saucer.",
    "In multiball, complete DMC again to light jackpots on both ramps.",
    "Check the skill shot after plunging. The left ramp collects whatever is lit: 100K, double score, or an extra ball."
  ],
  avoid: [
    "Forcing left-ramp shots from bad angles on a weak right flipper. Take the DMC route instead.",
